Preliminary Project Plan topics
ITT 18.2 (a) 
In addition to the topics described in ITT Clause 16.2 (a), the Preliminary Project Plan 
must address the following topics: [modify as appropriate]: 
i) Project Organization and Management Sub-Plan, including management authorities, 
responsibilities, and contacts, as well as task, time and resource-bound schedules (in 
GANTT format); 
ii) Implementation Sub-Plan; 
iii) Training Sub-Plan; 
iv) Testing and Quality Assurance Sub-Plan; 
v) Warranty Defect Repair and Technical Support Service Sub-Plan
